<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-St George plans A$360 mln raising.</title>
<headline>RTRS-St George plans A$360 mln raising.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>St George Bank Ltd said it plans to raise up to A$360 million in a new capital raising to help fund its A$2.65 billion merger with Advance Bank Australia Ltd.</p>
</text>
